study.\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Please complete this in a quiet room with minimal distraction.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>The study will take about 40 minutes. Please work continuously until the study is complete.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Click the arrow below to view the consent form.<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"i1_intro","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Welcome to the study. \u00a0 Please complete this in a quiet room with minimal distraction. \u00a0 The stud...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID114"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_eCCBTqsP30v4Rjo","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID115","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for participating in our study. \u00a0We aim to understand the core of creativity. There are..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Thank you for participating in our study.<div><br><div>&nbsp;We aim to understand the core of creativity. There are no known risks or benefits from participating in this study. It will take about 40 minutes to complete the study.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Your participation is completely voluntary, and you are free to withdraw at any time. Note that ONLY people who complete the entire task will be compensated. Any and all the information you provide will remain anonymous and will be used only for research purposes.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>&nbsp;Please complete this study in one sitting. Once you start please respond to all items.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>&nbsp;Your compensation for completing the survey will be \u00a34.6<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>&nbsp;If you have any questions concerning this study, please do not hesitate to email us at: creativityresearch1@gmail.com<\/div><\/div>","DataExportTag":"i