ual, interesting, uncommon, humorous, innovative, or different.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will be asked to type USES(not questions!) for 3 different objects.&nbsp;<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will have 2 minutes to type as many creative questions for each object as you can -- just press TAB after each one.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Press the arrow to begin.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For this task, you'll be asked to come up with as many original and creative USES (not questions!...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>For this task, you'll be asked to come up with as many original and creative USES (not questions!) for objects as you can. The goal is to come up with *creative USES*, which are USES that strike people as clever, unusual, interesting, uncommon, humorous, innovative, or different.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will be asked to type USES(not questions!) for 3 different objects.&nbsp;<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will have 2 minutes to type as many creative questions for each object as you can -- just press TAB after each one.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Press the arrow to begin.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q314","QuestionID":"QID314"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_eCCBTqsP30v4Rjo","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID315","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoi